+// combined guPerspective*guLookAt for THIS walk -- i.e. the matrix
+// FrameInterpolation just lerped -- so the camera position recovered from
+// it is the world's own interpolated motion, measured through a path that
+// contains no kart export, no seat, no head pose and no angle (trap D11:
+// the ground truth must not share a convention with the thing under test).
+// M[i][3] = s*fwd_i and M[3][3] = -s*dot(e,fwd); M[i][0] = p00*right_i and
+// M[3][0] = -p00*dot(e,right); likewise column 1. Normalising each column
+// gives an orthonormal basis and the three dot products, and e is their
+// linear combination -- no matrix inverse, no assumption about the near or
+// far planes.
